;stroke:#17744f !important" x="-130" y="-63" width="260" height="126"/><g class="label" style="color:#172231 !important" transform="translate(-100, -48)"><rect/><foreignObject width="200" height="96"><div style="color: rgb(23, 34, 49) !important; display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><span style="color:#172231 !important" class="nodeLabel"><p>Wave 4 · Strategic expansion<br />approved attributes and related domains</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g><defs><filter id="upc-09-roadmap-waves-drop-shadow" height="130%" width="130%"><feDropShadow dx="4" dy="4" stdDeviation="0" flood-opacity="0.06" flood-color="#000000"/></filter></defs><defs><filter id="upc-09-roadmap-waves-drop-shadow-small" height="150%" width="150%"><feDropShadow dx="2" dy="2" stdDeviation="0" flood-opacity="0.06" flood-color="#000000"/></filter></defs></svg></div></div><p class="diagram-caption">The arrows show prerequisites. A wave cannot be declared complete because work started or a date passed; the exit evidence below must be accepted.</p><details><summary>Editable Mermaid source</summary><pre class="source-code">flowchart TB
